## Alur Kerja Aplikasi

### Flowchart Utama

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START([Buka Aplikasi]) --> CHECK{SessionManager:\nIP tersimpan?}

    CHECK -->|Ya| BG_PING[Background Ping TCP port 80<br/>Tampilkan Banner Batal]
